        "testimonial_LEXiqK": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars_count": 5,
            "text": "<p>I wore my tee to work and two coworkers asked what it meant. That ten-minute conversation about faith is exactly why I keep coming back.</p>",
            "author": "Marcus T., Dallas, TX",
            "url": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_HjLAAL": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars_count": 5,
            "text": "<p>The quality genuinely surprised me. Soft, holds its shape wash after wash, and the print still looks brand new months later. Worth it.</p>",
            "author": "Hannah R., Verified buyer",
            "url": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_Q3NGCz": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars_count": 5,
            "text": "<p>Bought the hoodie as a gift for my brother and he has barely taken it off. Knowing it opens up Gospel conversations makes it mean more.</p>",
            "author": "Priya S., Columbus, OH",
            "url": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_UC73Qy": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars_count": 5,
            "text": "<p>Every piece feels intentional, never loud. People notice the message without me saying a word first, and it has opened so many doors.</p>",
            "author": "Daniel K., Phoenix, AZ",
            "url": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_fpnGqU": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars_count": 5,
            "text": "<p>Fast shipping, beautiful packaging, and a shirt that fits true to size. This has quietly become the brand I reach for almost every day.</p>",
            "author": "Grace M., Nashville, TN",
            "url": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_AKT7b9": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars_count": 5,
            "text": "<p>I love that what I wear reflects what I believe. The designs are modern enough that even my non-church friends keep asking where I got them.</p>",
            "author": "Josiah B., Denver, CO",
            "url": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_d9LBDQ": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars_count": 5,
            "text": "<p>Ordered three tees and each one became a conversation starter somewhere new. Comfortable, well made, and rooted in something that matters.</p>",
            "author": "Rebecca L., Tampa, FL",
            "url": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_krAkMD": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars_count": 5,
            "text": "<p>More than apparel, it feels like a mission you can wear. The fabric is premium and the heart behind this brand comes through in the details.</p>",
            "author": "Caleb W., Kansas City, MO",
            "url": ""
          }
        }
      },
